ACTION:

12.
ORDINANCE –3rd READING – Amending the Official Zoning Map of the City of
Cheyenne to assign a Zoning Classification of AG Agricultural to a parcel of land
annexed to the City, generally located east of South Greeley Highway and north of Chalk
Bluff Road.

ACTION:

13.
ORDINANCE –3rd READING –  Amending Section 10.04.050, Obedience Required, of
the Municipal Code of the City of Cheyenne, Wyoming, to clarify the default offense
level for violations of Title 10 of the Municipal Code.

ACTION:

14.
ORDINANCE –3rd READING – Amending Section 6.08.180, Feeding Geese and Ducks
Prohibited, of Chapter 6.08, Animal Care and Control Regulations Generally, of Title 6,
Animals, of the Municipal Code of the City of Cheyenne, Wyoming, to include seagulls
and extend the feeding prohibition to all property within city limits.

ACTION:
